Apple has revealed that it will charge a 5% core technology commission on digital transactions for apps distributed through alternative app marketplaces or the web in the EU from October 1st.&nbsp;

The move by the iPhone maker replaces its more complex fee structure as it seeks to comply with the bloc&rsquo;s Digital Markets Act. ... [<a href="https://www.pocketgamer.biz/apple-cuts-eu-alternative-app-store-fees-to-5/">MORE</a>]
